:name: head_unit
:description: head_unit display unit (STM32H747I-DISCO + 800x480 panel) running our firmware, with the UI assets on an emulated SD card.
:
:Build first and set $bin and $sdcard to the build's zephyr.elf and
:zephyr.sdcard.img -- see README.md for the full command. (No defaults:
:Renode does not expand $ORIGIN in the SD card path.)

$name ?= "head_unit"

using sysbus
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32h747-disco.repl
machine SdCardFromFile $sdcard sysbus.sdmmc 0x800000 false

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
